<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alex Brown changes focus list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alex Brown changes focus list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex Brown &amp; Sons Inc said it added four stocks to its Focus List and removed two.</p>
<p>-- added Genesis Health Ventures Inc, HCIA Inc, Nova Corp and Outback Steakhouse Inc.</p>
<p>-- Genesis shares added 1/2 to 28-3/4. HCIA jumped 2-1/8 to 30-1/4. Nova shares rose 2-3/4 to 22, and Outback shares rose 13/16 to 28-1/4.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage said it removed Scholastic Corp and FelCor Suite Hotels Inc from the list.</p>
<p>-- Scholastic shares fell 1/2 to 73-1/2. FelCor shares lost 3/8 to 35-1/4.</p>
</text>
